{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25421","headline":"离平泉马上作 · 李德裕","name":"离平泉马上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年紫殿掌洪钧，出入三朝一品身。\n文帝宠深陪雉尾，武皇恩厚宴龙津。\n黑山永破和亲虏，乌岭全阬跋扈臣。\n自是功高临尽处，祸来[名]灭不由人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}